msgid "所有参赛者准备后倒计时三秒开局。每人点击一次「结束游戏」，按房主收到点击的先后排名。所有在线参赛者按完后显示本轮结算，退出者不排名。 大厅“本机设置”提供控件、协议继承/覆盖与保存测试；样例值不改变玩法。"
msgstr "Confirm readiness, then press Finish Game once. The host ranks players by the order their presses arrive. Results appear after all connected participants finish; withdrawn players are unranked. Use Local Settings in the lobby to test controls, protocol inheritance, overrides and saving. Sample values do not change gameplay."

